      "Mr. McGregor jumped up and ran after Peter, waving a rake and calling out, Stop thief! Peter was most dreadfully frightened and rushed all over the garden.",
      "He lost one of his shoes among the cabbages, and the other shoe amongst the potatoes. After losing them he ran on four legs and went faster.",
