      "A few days later, the boy did it again. Wolf! Wolf! The villagers came running. Again, no wolf. The boy laughed and laughed.",
      "Then one day, a real wolf came out of the forest and began to attack the sheep. Wolf! Wolf! cried the boy. Help! Please help!",
