          if(r+1<ROWS){[grid[r][c],grid[r+1][c]]=[grid[r+1][c],grid[r][c]];const m=findMatches();[grid[r][c],grid[r+1][c]]=[grid[r+1][c],grid[r][c]];if(m.size>0){_bcells[r*COLS+c].classList.add('hint');_bcells[(r+1)*COLS+c].classList.add('hint');return;}}
